r"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"bufferDropReports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/_Concurrency/AsyncSequence":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequence","kind":"identifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/_Concurrency\/AsyncSequence","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/_concurrency\/asyncsequence","kind":"symbol","title":"AsyncSequence","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncSequence","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/BufferDropReport":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"BufferDropReport","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Batches a destination’s full buffer dropped before the destination received them."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/bufferdropreport","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","type":"topic"}}}